{"id":"4563061cac782dab","group":"29","path":"29/29-df-standard-inputs.md","title":"标准数值输入与布尔常数约定","display":"df-standard-inputs — 标准数值输入与布尔常数约定","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Descriptive Complexity (Neil Immerman)","book_abbrev":"29","label":"29-df-standard-inputs","aliases":["29-df-standard-inputs"],"display":"df-standard-inputs — 标准数值输入与布尔常数约定","depends_on":["[[29-df-ordering]]","[[29-df-fo-q-fo]]","[[29-df-relational-vocab]]","[[29-df-complexity-classes]]","[[29-df-bit]]"],"source_locator":"Provisos1.14–1.15, pp.13–14, scans28–29; §2.3 and Theorems3.16,3.23,3.26","source_basis":"原书条件已核对；以下显式扩张与查询限制接口为本地重构"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Descriptive Complexity (Neil Immerman)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"29"},{"key":"label","html":"29-df-standard-inputs"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>29-df-standard-inputs</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-standard-inputs — 标准数值输入与布尔常数约定"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"4f651c8d1bdc9a58\" href=\"?note=4f651c8d1bdc9a58\" title=\"29-df-ordering\">29-df-ordering</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"b89b00b2e37a4ae5\" href=\"?note=b89b00b2e37a4ae5\" title=\"29-df-fo-q-fo\">29-df-fo-q-fo</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"44836019093a45c6\" href=\"?note=44836019093a45c6\" title=\"29-df-relational-vocab\">29-df-relational-vocab</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"2017fdd1c0072445\" href=\"?note=2017fdd1c0072445\" title=\"29-df-complexity-classes\">29-df-complexity-classes</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"9f29a2487393d5b9\" href=\"?note=9f29a2487393d5b9\" title=\"29-df-bit\">29-df-bit</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_locator","html":"Provisos1.14–1.15, pp.13–14, scans28–29; §2.3 and Theorems3.16,3.23,3.26"},{"key":"source_basis","html":"原书条件已核对；以下显式扩张与查询限制接口为本地重构"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\tau\">\\(\\tau\\)</span> 为有限关系输入词汇，允许个体常量；下式数值词汇 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\nu\">\\(\\nu\\)</span> 的符号与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\tau\">\\(\\tau\\)</span> 不交。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"U=(A,L)\\in\\mathrm{OrdSTRUC}[\\tau]\">\\(U=(A,L)\\in\\mathrm{OrdSTRUC}[\\tau]\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n=\\operatorname{card}(|A|)\\geq2\">\\(n=\\operatorname{card}(|A|)\\geq2\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"e_U:[n]\\to|A|\">\\(e_U:[n]\\to|A|\\)</span> 是按 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"L\">\\(L\\)</span> 递增的唯一双射；其在元组上逐分量作用。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{BIT}(i,j)\">\\(\\mathrm{BIT}(i,j)\\)</span> 使用本库的位索引在前约定，见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"9f29a2487393d5b9\" href=\"?note=9f29a2487393d5b9\" title=\"29-df-bit\">29-df-bit</a>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\iota\">\\(\\iota\\)</span> 仅在存在唯一见证时使用。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"C\">\\(C\\)</span> 为 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"2017fdd1c0072445\" href=\"?note=2017fdd1c0072445\" title=\"29-df-complexity-classes\">29-df-complexity-classes</a> 中的资源类；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{RelationalVocab}\">\\(\\mathrm{RelationalVocab}\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"44836019093a45c6\" href=\"?note=44836019093a45c6\" title=\"29-df-relational-vocab\">29-df-relational-vocab</a>。</li>\n<li>本条及以下 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"C_{\\mathrm{std}}\">\\(C_{\\mathrm{std}}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{StdSTRUC}\">\\(\\mathrm{StdSTRUC}\\)</span> 都是元语言结构类/查询类记号；不在对象语言中量化全体集合。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\nu\\coloneqq\\langle&lt;^{(2)},\\mathrm{SUC}^{(2)},\\mathrm{BIT}^{(2)},\\mathrm{PLUS}^{(3)},\\mathrm{TIMES}^{(3)},0,1,\\max\\rangle.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\nu\\coloneqq\\langle&lt;^{(2)},\\mathrm{SUC}^{(2)},\\mathrm{BIT}^{(2)},\\mathrm{PLUS}^{(3)},\\mathrm{TIMES}^{(3)},0,1,\\max\\rangle.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{StdExpand}_\\tau(U)\\coloneqq\\iota B\\in\\mathrm{STRUC}[\\tau\\cup\\nu]\\;\\left(\\begin{aligned}&amp;|B|=|A|\\land B\\!\\upharpoonright_\\tau=A\\land &lt;^B=L\\\\&amp;\\land\\mathrm{SUC}^B=\\{(e_U(i),e_U(i+1))\\mid i\\in[n],\\ i+1&lt;n\\}\\\\&amp;\\land\\mathrm{BIT}^B=\\{(e_U(i),e_U(j))\\mid i,j\\in[n],\\ \\mathrm{BIT}(i,j)\\}\\\\&amp;\\land\\mathrm{PLUS}^B=\\{(e_U(i),e_U(j),e_U(k))\\mid i,j,k\\in[n],\\ i+j=k\\}\\\\&amp;\\land\\mathrm{TIMES}^B=\\{(e_U(i),e_U(j),e_U(k))\\mid i,j,k\\in[n],\\ ij=k\\}\\\\&amp;\\land 0^B=e_U(0)\\land1^B=e_U(1)\\land\\max^B=e_U(n-1)\\end{aligned}\\right).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{StdExpand}_\\tau(U)\\coloneqq\\iota B\\in\\mathrm{STRUC}[\\tau\\cup\\nu]\\;\\left(\\begin{aligned}&amp;|B|=|A|\\land B\\!\\upharpoonright_\\tau=A\\land &lt;^B=L\\\\&amp;\\land\\mathrm{SUC}^B=\\{(e_U(i),e_U(i+1))\\mid i\\in[n],\\ i+1&lt;n\\}\\\\&amp;\\land\\mathrm{BIT}^B=\\{(e_U(i),e_U(j))\\mid i,j\\in[n],\\ \\mathrm{BIT}(i,j)\\}\\\\&amp;\\land\\mathrm{PLUS}^B=\\{(e_U(i),e_U(j),e_U(k))\\mid i,j,k\\in[n],\\ i+j=k\\}\\\\&amp;\\land\\mathrm{TIMES}^B=\\{(e_U(i),e_U(j),e_U(k))\\mid i,j,k\\in[n],\\ ij=k\\}\\\\&amp;\\land 0^B=e_U(0)\\land1^B=e_U(1)\\land\\max^B=e_U(n-1)\\end{aligned}\\right).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{StdSTRUC}[\\tau]\\coloneqq\\{\\operatorname{StdExpand}_\\tau(U)\\mid U=(A,L)\\in\\mathrm{OrdSTRUC}[\\tau],\\ \\operatorname{card}(|A|)\\geq2\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{StdSTRUC}[\\tau]\\coloneqq\\{\\operatorname{StdExpand}_\\tau(U)\\mid U=(A,L)\\in\\mathrm{OrdSTRUC}[\\tau],\\ \\operatorname{card}(|A|)\\geq2\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"C_{\\mathrm{std}}[\\tau]\\coloneqq\\{S\\cap\\mathrm{StdSTRUC}[\\tau]\\mid S\\in C[\\tau\\cup\\nu]\\},\\qquad C_{\\mathrm{std}}\\coloneqq\\bigcup_{\\substack{\\tau\\in\\mathrm{RelationalVocab}\\\\\\tau\\cap\\nu=\\varnothing}}C_{\\mathrm{std}}[\\tau].\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[C_{\\mathrm{std}}[\\tau]\\coloneqq\\{S\\cap\\mathrm{StdSTRUC}[\\tau]\\mid S\\in C[\\tau\\cup\\nu]\\},\\qquad C_{\\mathrm{std}}\\coloneqq\\bigcup_{\\substack{\\tau\\in\\mathrm{RelationalVocab}\\\\\\tau\\cap\\nu=\\varnothing}}C_{\\mathrm{std}}[\\tau].\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>原书 Provisos 1.14–1.15，印刷页13–14、扫描页28–29：数值关系有标准意义，结构至少有两个元素。现有 STRUC 仍包括单元素结构，适用于无序模型论；本条单独恢复书中后续弱归约与完全性陈述的适用范围。否则在只允许域为输入元组子集的FO查询下，单元素负实例不能映成具有不同s,t的REACH负实例。</p>\n<p>域、每个旧符号的解释和每个新增数值解释均已给出，所以扩张存在唯一；n≥2保证数值常量0与1不同。本库BIT参数顺序与原书相反，明确换位后互相对应，不改变算术关系。Cstd是资源类在指定合法输入域上的限制，仍携带具体输入词汇。未规定不合法数值扩张上的结果。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"29-df-ordering","status":"resolved","id":"4f651c8d1bdc9a58","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[29-df-ordering]]","embed":false},{"target":"29-df-fo-q-fo","status":"resolved","id":"b89b00b2e37a4ae5","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[29-df-fo-q-fo]]","embed":false},{"target":"29-df-relational-vocab","status":"resolved","id":"44836019093a45c6","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[29-df-relational-vocab]]","embed":false},{"target":"29-df-complexity-classes","status":"resolved","id":"2017fdd1c0072445","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[29-df-complexity-classes]]","embed":false},{"target":"29-df-bit","status":"resolved","id":"9f29a2487393d5b9","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[29-df-bit]]","embed":false},{"target":"29-df-bit","status":"resolved","id":"9f29a2487393d5b9","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$e_U:[n]\\to|A|$ 是按 $L$ 递增的唯一双射；其在元组上逐分量作用。$\\mathrm{BIT}(i,j)$ 使用本库的位索引在前约定，见 [[29-df-bit]]。","embed":false},{"target":"29-df-complexity-classes","status":"resolved","id":"2017fdd1c0072445","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\iota$ 仅在存在唯一见证时使用。$C$ 为 [[29-df-complexity-classes]] 中的资源类；$\\mathrm{RelationalVocab}$ 见 [[29-df-relational-vocab]]。","embed":false},{"target":"29-df-relational-vocab","status":"resolved","id":"44836019093a45c6","anchor":"ref-8","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\iota$ 仅在存在唯一见证时使用。$C$ 为 [[29-df-complexity-classes]] 中的资源类；$\\mathrm{RelationalVocab}$ 见 [[29-df-relational-vocab]]。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"\\tau","display":false},{"tex":"\\nu","display":false},{"tex":"\\tau","display":false},{"tex":"U=(A,L)\\in\\mathrm{OrdSTRUC}[\\tau]","display":false},{"tex":"n=\\operatorname{card}(|A|)\\geq2","display":false},{"tex":"e_U:[n]\\to|A|","display":false},{"tex":"L","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{BIT}(i,j)","display":false},{"tex":"\\iota","display":false},{"tex":"C","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{RelationalVocab}","display":false},{"tex":"C_{\\mathrm{std}}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{StdSTRUC}","display":false},{"tex":"\\nu\\coloneqq\\langle<^{(2)},\\mathrm{SUC}^{(2)},\\mathrm{BIT}^{(2)},\\mathrm{PLUS}^{(3)},\\mathrm{TIMES}^{(3)},0,1,\\max\\rangle.","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{StdExpand}_\\tau(U)\\coloneqq\\iota B\\in\\mathrm{STRUC}[\\tau\\cup\\nu]\\;\\left(\\begin{aligned}&|B|=|A|\\land B\\!\\upharpoonright_\\tau=A\\land <^B=L\\\\&\\land\\mathrm{SUC}^B=\\{(e_U(i),e_U(i+1))\\mid i\\in[n],\\ i+1<n\\}\\\\&\\land\\mathrm{BIT}^B=\\{(e_U(i),e_U(j))\\mid i,j\\in[n],\\ \\mathrm{BIT}(i,j)\\}\\\\&\\land\\mathrm{PLUS}^B=\\{(e_U(i),e_U(j),e_U(k))\\mid i,j,k\\in[n],\\ i+j=k\\}\\\\&\\land\\mathrm{TIMES}^B=\\{(e_U(i),e_U(j),e_U(k))\\mid i,j,k\\in[n],\\ ij=k\\}\\\\&\\land 0^B=e_U(0)\\land1^B=e_U(1)\\land\\max^B=e_U(n-1)\\end{aligned}\\right).","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{StdSTRUC}[\\tau]\\coloneqq\\{\\operatorname{StdExpand}_\\tau(U)\\mid U=(A,L)\\in\\mathrm{OrdSTRUC}[\\tau],\\ \\operatorname{card}(|A|)\\geq2\\}.","display":true},{"tex":"C_{\\mathrm{std}}[\\tau]\\coloneqq\\{S\\cap\\mathrm{StdSTRUC}[\\tau]\\mid S\\in C[\\tau\\cup\\nu]\\},\\qquad C_{\\mathrm{std}}\\coloneqq\\bigcup_{\\substack{\\tau\\in\\mathrm{RelationalVocab}\\\\\\tau\\cap\\nu=\\varnothing}}C_{\\mathrm{std}}[\\tau].","display":true}],"bytes":3154,"backlinks":[{"id":"ecf0316ce54c8b96","anchor":"ref-5","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\tau_{ag}=\\langle E^{(2)},A^{(1)},s,t\\rangle$，$A$标记全称顶点；$\\mathrm{StdSTRUC}$ 见 [[29-df-standard-inputs]]。"},{"id":"fe0c97f9faf86d63","anchor":"ref-8","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\leq_{\\mathrm{fo,std}}$ 及 $\\mathrm L_{\\mathrm{std}},\\mathrm{NL}_{\\mathrm{std}},\\mathrm P_{\\mathrm{std}},\\mathrm{PSPACE}_{\\mathrm{std}}$ 见 [[29-df-first-order-reduction]]、[[29-df-standard-inputs]]。"},{"id":"65b448b4269ca18e","anchor":"ref-5","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\nu,\\mathrm{StdSTRUC}$ 使用 [[29-df-standard-inputs]]；标准输入归约的查询都携带与 $\\nu$ 不交的有限关系输入词汇；其实际输入、输出结构词汇分别为 $\\sigma\\cup\\nu$、$\\tau\\cup\\nu$。$\\mathrm{RelationalVocab}$ 见该上游。"},{"id":"38909ffa6d1e85ce","anchor":"ref-147","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[29-df-standard-inputs]] — 原书默认数值解释与至少两元素的弱归约输入条件"},{"id":"41143d1e9b3932ce","anchor":"ref-8","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\tau_q=\\langle P^{(2)},N^{(2)},U^{(1)}\\rangle$，$A\\in\\mathrm{StdSTRUC}[\\tau_q]$，$n=\\operatorname{card}(|A|)\\geq2$；$[n]=\\{0,\\ldots,n-1\\}$。$<^A$ 是 [[29-df-standard-inputs]] 的标准序，$e_A$ 是下式唯一确定的递增枚举。每个元素同时索引一个变量和一个子句；$U$ 标记全称变量，$P,N$ 标记子句中的正负出现。"},{"id":"9403bcdfde263660","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\tau_g=\\langle E^{(2)},s,t\\rangle$ 是带指定端点的图词汇。$\\mathrm{StdSTRUC}$ 见 [[29-df-standard-inputs]]；结构 $A$ 的图约化 $G_A$ 由下式构造。"},{"id":"3c678e2ee71047b3","anchor":"ref-7","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{StdSTRUC}[\\tau]$ 与 $\\mathrm{PSPACE}_{\\mathrm{std}}$ 使用 [[29-df-standard-inputs]]，词汇包含标准数值关系且域至少两个元素。"},{"id":"240580939d1fd13a","anchor":"ref-7","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{StdSTRUC}[\\tau]$ 与 $\\mathrm{P}_{\\mathrm{std}}$ 使用 [[29-df-standard-inputs]]，词汇包含标准数值关系且域至少两个元素。"},{"id":"e33d8f1b508c3705","anchor":"ref-7","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{StdSTRUC}[\\tau]$ 与 $\\mathrm{L}_{\\mathrm{std}}$ 使用 [[29-df-standard-inputs]]，词汇包含标准数值关系且域至少两个元素。"},{"id":"b2a4804023516b8f","anchor":"ref-7","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{StdSTRUC}[\\tau]$ 与 $\\mathrm{NL}_{\\mathrm{std}}$ 使用 [[29-df-standard-inputs]]，词汇包含标准数值关系且域至少两个元素。"},{"id":"ecc0dd131d213345","anchor":"ref-133","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../29-df-standard-inputs]]"},{"id":"ef134b4589bf7f20","anchor":"ref-9","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../29-df-standard-inputs|29-df-standard-inputs]]"}],"outgoing":["4f651c8d1bdc9a58","b89b00b2e37a4ae5","44836019093a45c6","2017fdd1c0072445","9f29a2487393d5b9"]}